# 行尾统一（2026-09-10）：仓库里一直混着 CRLF 与 LF（43 : 75），每次批量改文件都要额外小心
# 「别把行尾换了」，diff 里也经常出现整文件变更。库内一律存 LF，检出时不转换——
# Windows 上的编辑器与 Python 都能正常处理 LF，构建脚本也不依赖 CRLF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：不做任何行尾处理，也不进 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.m4a binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.ttf binary
*.ttc binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pyc binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pyd binary

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF：有些老工具链对 .bat/.cmd 的 LF 行尾会解析出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
